{"seq":1,"slug":"mqtt-and-coap","title":"MQTT 与 CoAP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/mqtt-and-coap","wordCount":772,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"mqtt-与-coap-协议\">MQTT 与 CoAP 协议</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MQTT 和 CoAP 是物联网领域最主流的两种应用层协议。MQTT（Message Queuing Telemetry Transport）基于 TCP 的发布/订阅模型，适合需要可靠消息传递的场景；CoAP（Constrained Application Protocol）基于 UDP 的请求/响应模型，专为资源受限设备设计。两者在协议开销、传输可靠性和适用场景上各有侧重。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[IoT 应用层协议] --&gt; B[MQTT]&#10;    A --&gt; C[CoAP]&#10;    B --&gt; D[TCP 传输]&#10;    B --&gt; E[发布/订阅模型]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Broker 中心架构]&#10;    C --&gt; G[UDP 传输]&#10;    C --&gt; H[请求/响应模型]&#10;    C --&gt; I[资源发现机制]&#10;    A --&gt; J[MQTT-SN]&#10;    J --&gt; K[UDP 上的 MQTT 变体]\">graph TD\n    A[IoT 应用层协议] --&gt; B[MQTT]\n    A --&gt; C[CoAP]\n    B --&gt; D[TCP 传输]\n    B --&gt; E[发布/订阅模型]\n    B --&gt; F[Broker 中心架构]\n    C --&gt; G[UDP 传输]\n    C --&gt; H[请求/响应模型]\n    C --&gt; I[资源发现机制]\n    A --&gt; J[MQTT-SN]\n    J --&gt; K[UDP 上的 MQTT 变体]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MQTT</th>\n<th>CoAP</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>UDP</td>\n<td>MQTT 可靠但开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信模型</td>\n<td>发布/订阅</td>\n<td>请求/响应</td>\n<td>MQTT 解耦更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息头开销</td>\n<td>2 字节起</td>\n<td>4 字节固定</td>\n<td>两者都很紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全机制</td>\n<td>TLS</td>\n<td>DTLS</td>\n<td>CoAP 用 DTLS over UDP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源发现</td>\n<td>无原生支持</td>\n<td>/.well-known/core</td>\n<td>CoAP 内建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QoS 等级</td>\n<td>0/1/2</td>\n<td>CON/NON</td>\n<td>粒度不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准组织</td>\n<td>OASIS</td>\n<td>IETF（RFC 7252）</td>\n<td>均为开放标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mqtt-协议深入\">MQTT 协议深入</h2><h3 id=\"发布-订阅架构\">发布/订阅架构</h3><p>MQTT 采用 Broker 中心化架构，发布者和订阅者通过 Broker 解耦。客户端无需知道对方的存在，只需关注主题（Topic）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// ESP32 + MQTT 客户端示例（基于 ESP-IDF）&#10;#include &quot;mqtt_client.h&quot;&#10;&#10;esp_mqtt_client_config_t mqtt_cfg = {&#10;    .broker.address.uri = &quot;mqtt://broker.example.com:1883&quot;,&#10;    .credentials.username = &quot;device_001&quot;,&#10;    .credentials.authentication.password = &quot;secret&quot;,&#10;    .session.keepalive = 60,&#10;    .session.last_will.topic = &quot;devices/001/status&quot;,&#10;    .session.last_will.msg = &quot;offline&quot;,&#10;    .session.last_will.qos = 1,&#10;    .session.last_will.retain = 1,&#10;};&#10;&#10;esp_mqtt_client_handle_t client = esp_mqtt_client_init(&amp;mqtt_cfg);&#10;esp_mqtt_client_register_event(client, ESP_EVENT_ANY_ID, mqtt_event_handler, NULL);&#10;esp_mqtt_client_start(client);&#10;&#10;void mqtt_event_handler(void *args, esp_event_base_t base,&#10;                        int32_t event_id, void *event_data) {&#10;    esp_mqtt_event_handle_t event = event_data;&#10;    switch (event-&gt;event_id) {&#10;        case MQTT_EVENT_CONNECTED:&#10;            esp_mqtt_client_subscribe(client, &quot;sensors/+/temperature&quot;, 1);&#10;            break;&#10;        case MQTT_EVENT_DATA:&#10;            process_message(event-&gt;topic, event-&gt;topic_len,&#10;                          event-&gt;data, event-&gt;data_len);&#10;            break;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ESP32 + MQTT 客户端示例（基于 ESP-IDF）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"mqtt_client.h\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">esp_mqtt_client_config_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mqtt_cfg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .broker.address.uri </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"mqtt://broker.example.com:1883\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .credentials.username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"device_001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .credentials.authentication.password </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"secret\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .session.keepalive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .session.last_will.topic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"devices/001/status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .session.last_will.msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"offline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .session.last_will.qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .session.last_will.retain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">esp_mqtt_client_handle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> esp_mqtt_client_init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mqtt_cfg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">esp_mqtt_client_register_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client, ESP_EVENT_ANY_ID, mqtt_event_handler, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">esp_mqtt_client_start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mqtt_event_handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">esp_event_base_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> base</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        int32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> event_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    esp_mqtt_event_handle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event->event_id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MQTT_EVENT_CONNECTED:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            esp_mqtt_client_subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sensors/+/temperature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MQTT_EVENT_DATA:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            process_message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">topic_len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data_len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"qos-等级\">QoS 等级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>QoS 等级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>传递保证</th>\n<th>消息流</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>至多一次</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n<td>PUBLISH →</td>\n<td>环境监测（容忍丢失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>至少一次</td>\n<td>可能重复</td>\n<td>PUBLISH → PUBACK</td>\n<td>设备控制（需确认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>恰好一次</td>\n<td>不丢不重</td>\n<td>四步握手</td>\n<td>计费系统（要求精确）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"主题设计最佳实践\">主题设计最佳实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# IoT 主题层级设计&#10;{region}/{building}/{floor}/{device_type}/{device_id}/{data_type}&#10;&#10;# 示例&#10;cn-east/factory-a/2f/sensor/temp-001/temperature&#10;cn-east/factory-a/2f/sensor/+/humidity        # + 匹配单层&#10;cn-east/factory-a/#                            # # 匹配多层&#10;&#10;# 系统主题&#10;$SYS/broker/clients/connected                  # Broker 系统状态&#10;devices/{device_id}/cmd                        # 下行指令&#10;devices/{device_id}/cmd/response               # 指令响应\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># IoT 主题层级设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{region}/{building}/{floor}/{device_type}/{device_id}/{data_type}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cn-east/factory-a/2f/sensor/temp-001/temperature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cn-east/factory-a/2f/sensor/+/humidity        # + 匹配单层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cn-east/factory-a/#                            # # 匹配多层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 系统主题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$SYS/broker/clients/connected                  # Broker 系统状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device_id}/cmd                        # 下行指令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device_id}/cmd/response               # 指令响应</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"coap-协议深入\">CoAP 协议深入</h2><h3 id=\"restful-资源模型\">RESTful 资源模型</h3><p>CoAP 将每个传感器数据和执行器控制映射为 URI 资源，使用与 HTTP 类似的 GET/PUT/POST/DELETE 方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// CoAP 服务端示例（基于 libcoap）&#10;#include &lt;coap3/coap.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void temperature_handler(coap_resource_t *resource,&#10;                        coap_session_t *session,&#10;                        const coap_pdu_t *request,&#10;                        const coap_string_t *query,&#10;                        coap_pdu_t *response) {&#10;    float temp = read_temperature_sensor();&#10;    char buf[32];&#10;    int len = snprintf(buf, sizeof(buf), &quot;{\\&quot;temp\\&quot;:%.1f}&quot;, temp);&#10;&#10;    coap_pdu_set_code(response, COAP_RESPONSE_CODE_CONTENT);&#10;    coap_add_option(response, COAP_OPTION_CONTENT_FORMAT,&#10;                    coap_encode_var_safe(opt, sizeof(opt),&#10;                    COAP_MEDIATYPE_APPLICATION_JSON), opt);&#10;    coap_add_data(response, len, (uint8_t *)buf);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 注册资源&#10;coap_resource_t *r = coap_resource_init(coap_make_str_const(&quot;temperature&quot;), 0);&#10;coap_register_handler(r, COAP_REQUEST_GET, temperature_handler);&#10;coap_resource_set_get_observable(r, 1);  // 支持 Observe&#10;coap_add_resource(ctx, r);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CoAP 服务端示例（基于 libcoap）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;coap3/coap.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> temperature_handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coap_resource_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                        coap_session_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coap_pdu_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> coap_string_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                        coap_pdu_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read_temperature_sensor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> snprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">temp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%.1f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, temp);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    coap_pdu_set_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response, COAP_RESPONSE_CODE_CONTENT);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    coap_add_option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response, COAP_OPTION_CONTENT_FORMAT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                    coap_encode_var_safe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opt, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(opt),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    COAP_MEDIATYPE_APPLICATION_JSON), opt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    coap_add_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response, len, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注册资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coap_resource_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> coap_resource_init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coap_make_str_const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"temperature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coap_register_handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, COAP_REQUEST_GET, temperature_handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coap_resource_set_get_observable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 支持 Observe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coap_add_resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, r);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"observe-机制\">Observe 机制</h3><p>CoAP 的 Observe 扩展（RFC 7641）允许客户端订阅资源变化通知，弥补了请求/响应模型在实时推送方面的不足：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端                          服务端&#10;  |--- GET /temperature -------&gt;|    (Observe: 0)&#10;  |&lt;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 1, temp=25.3)&#10;  |                              |    ... 温度变化 ...&#10;  |&lt;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 2, temp=26.1)&#10;  |&lt;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 3, temp=25.8)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端                          服务端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |--- GET /temperature ------->|    (Observe: 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |&#x3C;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 1, temp=25.3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |                              |    ... 温度变化 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |&#x3C;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 2, temp=26.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |&#x3C;-- 2.05 Content ------------|    (Observe: 3, temp=25.8)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CoAP 消息类型</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Confirmable</td>\n<td>CON</td>\n<td>需 ACK</td>\n<td>重要数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Non-confirmable</td>\n<td>NON</td>\n<td>无确认</td>\n<td>周期性数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Acknowledgement</td>\n<td>ACK</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>确认 CON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reset</td>\n<td>RST</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协议选型与网关设计\">协议选型与网关设计</h2><p>在实际 IoT 部署中，设备端通常使用轻量协议（CoAP/MQTT-SN），通过边缘网关桥接到云端的 MQTT Broker 或 HTTP API：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[受限设备] --&gt;|CoAP/UDP| B[边缘网关]&#10;    C[传感器节点] --&gt;|MQTT-SN| B&#10;    D[WiFi 设备] --&gt;|MQTT/TCP| E[云端 Broker]&#10;    B --&gt;|MQTT/TLS| E&#10;    E --&gt; F[数据平台]&#10;    E --&gt; G[规则引擎]\">graph LR\n    A[受限设备] --&gt;|CoAP/UDP| B[边缘网关]\n    C[传感器节点] --&gt;|MQTT-SN| B\n    D[WiFi 设备] --&gt;|MQTT/TCP| E[云端 Broker]\n    B --&gt;|MQTT/TLS| E\n    E --&gt; F[数据平台]\n    E --&gt; G[规则引擎]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选型条件</th>\n<th>推荐协议</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>受限设备（&lt;100KB RAM）</td>\n<td>CoAP</td>\n<td>UDP 开销小，内存占用低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠消息传递</td>\n<td>MQTT QoS 1/2</td>\n<td>TCP 保证 + 应用层确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大规模设备管理</td>\n<td>MQTT</td>\n<td>Broker 支持百万级连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源发现</td>\n<td>CoAP</td>\n<td>原生 /.well-known/core</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低功耗广域网</td>\n<td>CoAP / MQTT-SN</td>\n<td>UDP 友好、报文紧凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向实时控制</td>\n<td>MQTT</td>\n<td>持久连接 + 即时推送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MQTT 基于 TCP 发布/订阅模型，适合需要可靠传递和大规模设备管理的场景</li>\n<li>CoAP 基于 UDP RESTful 模型，专为资源受限设备设计，支持资源发现和 Observe 订阅</li>\n<li>MQTT 的三级 QoS 提供从「至多一次」到「恰好一次」的传递保证</li>\n<li>CoAP 的 Observe 机制弥补了请求/响应模型的实时推送不足</li>\n<li>实际部署常采用混合架构：设备端 CoAP/MQTT-SN → 边缘网关 → 云端 MQTT Broker</li>\n<li>主题/资源设计是 IoT 系统可维护性的关键，需遵循层级化、可通配的命名规范</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MQTT 与 CoAP 协议","id":"mqtt-与-coap-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MQTT 协议深入","id":"mqtt-协议深入"},{"level":3,"text":"发布/订阅架构","id":"发布-订阅架构"},{"level":3,"text":"QoS 等级","id":"qos-等级"},{"level":3,"text":"主题设计最佳实践","id":"主题设计最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"CoAP 协议深入","id":"coap-协议深入"},{"level":3,"text":"RESTful 资源模型","id":"restful-资源模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Observe 机制","id":"observe-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"协议选型与网关设计","id":"协议选型与网关设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"嵌入式项目工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/applications/embedded-project-practices"},"next":{"title":"蓝牙与 Zigbee 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/bluetooth-and-zigbee"}}